            "body": "Based on the verbosity of the PR description,  you did not read CONTRIBUTING.md. Please do so before any future PRs.\r\n\r\n\r\nlibghostty https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/39773 will land soonish (before end of year), but the new test added here will likely be useful for it, so this is worth having.\r\n\r\nAI findings:\r\n\r\n> `\\e[38:2:255:128:0:1m` changes from `rgb(255,128,0)` to `rgb(128,0,1)`. That's the T.416-conformant reading and presumably the point of the PR, but nothing in the description or the test says so.\r\n\r\nit found other bugs, but doesn't matter bc we are moving to libghostty soon.",
